WEBVTT

00:00:29.516 --> 00:00:32.796
Steve was tall and distinguished
and very decent.

00:00:32.836 --> 00:00:36.716
And he sat down and he reached
for the squishy stress ball on my desk,

00:00:36.756 --> 00:00:39.756
and he said that I wasn't
going to be making partner after all.

00:00:40.676 --> 00:00:44.956
And I remember very badly
wishing that I had a stress ball too,

00:00:44.996 --> 00:00:47.836
but Steve Shalen was using mine.

00:00:47.876 --> 00:00:51.436
And I remember feeling sorry
that it had fallen to Steve

00:00:51.436 --> 00:00:53.196
to be the one to tell me this news,

00:00:53.196 --> 00:00:55.116
because he really was a good guy.

00:00:55.116 --> 00:00:59.276
And I remember bursting into tears
right in front of him,

00:00:59.276 --> 00:01:02.196
such a nonpartnerish thing to do.